      W <= k_p √(W + B) + 4√(2(W + B)/(πD)) + A_D + p|E L|,   k_p = √env(p)/π,
  where A_D = sup_{|λ|<=T} Σ_{d<=D}|E[a_d(|Z|;λ) cos(d·arg Z); |Z| <= T]| <= (4/π) Σ_{d<=D} d^{−2}·δ_d, and
