 ## R6-D: a direct phase-consistent spectral formulation of the missing lemma
 
-PROVED (exact finite formal class). Fix X,n and an even integer Y with 4X<=Y<=8X. Let a be an even function on Z/Y with a_0=0, a_m=0 outside {1,...,X,-1,...,-X}, and a_m in {0,1}; require sum a=2n and n>=X/C. Its complete real Fourier array is
