codex
The model also needs to keep the central lobe explicitly. For every dense set, the radius-1/X windows centered at peaks of height o(X) miss a fixed positive amount of energy near zero. So requiring all energy to lie in mesoscopic spikes would make the model inconsistent for a reason that does not prove T-dense.

I’ve separated that issue from the substantive results: the lifting obstruction, the weighted SG refinement, and the remaining completion lemma.

